      "why": "defends hard-coded constraints against the argument that better models make them obsolete"
    },
    {
      "text": "when I was young, was on the farm with my dad, and I asked him, \"How do you know that this tree is a maple?\" And he couldn't tell me.",
      "timestamp_sec": 423,
